<title>NEW ZEALAND: Macraes lifts annual profit by 118 pct.</title>
<headline>Macraes lifts annual profit by 118 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   15.44 vs 7.09</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  12.19 vs 5.6</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.0 vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			    100.73 vs 88.24</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			23.64 vs 11.35</p>
<p>    Tax				     8.19 vs 4.26</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   126.8 vs 126.5</p>
<p>Dividend carries no imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Mar 26</p>
<p>Reg date Mar 14</p>
<p>    Ex div   Mar 17</p>
<p>Note - Macraes Mining Co Ltd is a gold miner.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
